A||||4||sully5||Shifter knob removal||||1||
Z||000000||sully5||03-12-2000||02:42 PM||||OK, what is the trick for removing the automatic tranny shifter knob? Figured I would ask before I ended up destroying the one in my car. Thanks. <BR>Dave||||reg||1
Z||000001||Shiner||03-12-2000||02:55 PM||||Put the shifter in first gear position with the car off.  Take a pair of needle nose pliers and remove that little metal clip in the front side of the shifter knob.  Then just pull her off.||||reg||1
Z||000002||BAM-BAM||03-12-2000||03:02 PM||||  Yup, What Shiner said  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||6
Z||000003||sully5||03-12-2000||05:05 PM||||Got it. Thanks a lot. Appreciate the help. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
